<title>HONG KONG: China Strategic director retires.</title>
<headline>China Strategic director retires.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Strategic Holdings Ltd said on Thursday that Andrew Liu had retired as a director of the company.</p>
<p>China Strategic is an investment holding company with interests in restaurant operations and property investment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
</text>
